Shizuqu (working name) - an Android 17 compatible fork of Shizuku

This product includes software developed by RikkaApps and contributors:

  Shizuku         https://github.com/RikkaApps/Shizuku         Apache License 2.0
  Shizuku-API     https://github.com/RikkaApps/Shizuku-API     Apache License 2.0  (api/)
  HiddenApi       https://github.com/RikkaW/HiddenApi          MIT License         (hidden-api/)

Shizuku is a trademark-like name of the upstream project; this fork does not
use it as its app name and does not ship upstream's launcher icons
(see README.md, "License").

Files changed by this fork are listed in the git history (every change is a
separate commit on top of upstream commit b844bc49 and the vendored
Shizuku-API a27f6e4 / HiddenApi 28122e6), and summarized in
docs/ANDROID17.md and hidden-api/PATCHES.md.
